<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian govt says strong interest in rail sale.</title>
<headline>Australian govt says strong interest in rail sale.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Finance Minister John Fahey said on Tuesday there was strong interest in the sale of its wholly-owned rail operator Australian National (AN).</p>
<p>&quot;From over 50 expressions of interest in Australian National, a strong shortlist of prospective bidders has been selected and will now proceed to the next stage of the sale process,&quot; Fahey said in a statement.</p>
</text>
